Media elements and Media Source Extensions with embedder-supplied engines.

VIDEO and MEDIA_SOURCE are on. MediaPlayer gains a hook through which the
embedder registers its media engines, which play through the host page's
media stack; WebCore keeps the elements, the controls and the MSE logic.

